/*
 * finding_registry.def
 *
 * Authoritative list of all v1 finding codes.
 * Used by:
 *   - make check-coverage  (verify test coverage)
 *   - src/eval/findings.c  (finding metadata table via X-macro)
 *   - docs/finding-registry.md (human reference)
 *
 * Format: X(ENUM_NAME, "STRING_ID")
 *
 * To add a finding:
 *   1. Add entry here
 *   2. Add test_<STRING_ID>_fires() and test_<STRING_ID>_no_fire()
 *   3. Update docs/finding-registry.md
 *   4. Add CHANGELOG entry
 */

